:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Usually 18–32 years<o:p></o:p></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Attempts<o:p></o:p></p></td><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">No fixed limit<o:p></o:p></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Language<o:p></o:p></p></td><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">English &amp; Hindi<o:p></o:p></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Exam Frequency<o:p></o:p></p></td><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Once a year<o:p></o:p></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Mode<o:p></o:p></p></td><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Online CBT<o:p></o:p></p></td></tr>\n</tbody></table><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><br></p><p><strong>14. Best Preparation Strategy</strong></p><table><thead><tr><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Subject<o:p></o:p></b></p></td><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Recommended Focus<o:p></o:p></b></p></td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Maths<o:p></o:p></p></td><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Daily Practice<o:p></o:p></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">English<o:p></o:p></p></td><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Vocabulary + Grammar<o:p></o:p></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Reasoning<o:p></o:p></p></td><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Short Tricks<o:p></o:p></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">GK<o:p></o:p></p></td><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Current Affairs + Static GK<o:p></o:p></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Typing<o:p></o:p></p></td><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Daily Typing Practice<o:p></o:p></p></td></tr>\n</tbody></table><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><br></p><p><strong>15. Recommended Daily Study Time</strong></p><table><thead><tr><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Preparation Level<o:p></o:p></b></p></td><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Daily Hours<o:p></o:p></b></p></td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Beginner<o:p></o:p></p></td><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">4–5 Hours<o:p></o:p></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Intermediate<o:p></o:p></p></td><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">6–7 Hours<o:p></o:p></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Serious Aspirant<o:p></o:p></p></td><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">8+ Hours<o:p></o:p></p></td></tr>\n</tbody></table><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><br></p><p><strong>16. SSC CGL Preparation Priority</strong></p><p><strong>Highest Weightage Subjects</strong></p><ol><li>Quantitative Aptitude</li><li>English Language</li><li>Reasoning</li><li>General Awareness</li><li>Computer Knowledge</li></ol><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><br></p><p><strong>17. Final Merit Calculation</strong></p><table><thead><tr><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Stage<o:p></o:p></b></p></td><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Counted in Final Merit?<o:p></o:p></b></p></td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Tier 1<o:p></o:p></p></td><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">No (Qualifying)<o:p></o:p></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Tier 2<o:p></o:p></p></td><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Yes<o:p></o:p></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">DEST<o:p></o:p></p></td><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Qualifying<o:p></o:p></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Document Verification<o:p></o:p></p></td><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Mandatory<o:p></o:p></p></td></tr>\n</tbody></table><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><br></p><p><strong>18. Quick Summary Table</strong></p><table><thead><tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:0;mso-yfti-firstrow:yes;height:25.65pt\"><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;height:25.65pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Feature<o:p></o:p></b></p></td><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;height:25.65pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Tier 1<o:p></o:p></b></p></td><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;height:25.65pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Tier 2<o:p></o:p></b></p></td></tr></thead><tbody><tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:1;height:26.45pt\"><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;height:26.45pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Questions<o:p></o:p></p></td><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;height:26.45pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">100<o:p></o:p></p></td><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;height:26.45pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">150<o:p></o:p></p></td></tr><tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:2;height:25.65pt\"><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;height:25.65pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Marks<o:p></o:p></p></td><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;height:25.65pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">200<o:p></o:p></p></td><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;height:25.65pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">390<o:p></o:p></p></td></tr><tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:3;height:25.65pt\"><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;height:25.65pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Time<o:p></o:p></p></td><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;height:25.65pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">60 min<o:p></o:p></p></td><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;height:25.65pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">2 hr 15 min<o:p></o:p></p></td></tr><tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:4;height:25.65pt\"><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;height:25.65pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Negative Marking<o:p></o:p></p></td><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;height:25.65pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">0.50<o:p></o:p></p></td><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;height:25.65pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">1 &amp; 0.50<o:p></o:p></p></td></tr><tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:5;height:26.45pt\"><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;height:26.45pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Mode<o:p></o:p></p></td><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;height:26.45pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Online<o:p></o:p></p></td><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;height:26.45pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Online<o:p></o:p></p></td></tr><tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:6;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;height:25.65pt\"><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;height:25.65pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Nature<o:p></o:p></p></td><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;height:25.65pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Qualifying<o:p></o:p></p></td><td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;height:25.65pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Merit Based<o:p></o:p></p></td></tr>\n</tbody></table><p class=\"ql-align-center\"><br></p><p><strong>19. Official Notification &amp; Syllabus</strong></p><ul><li><a href=\"https://ssc.gov.in/?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">SSC Official Portal</a></li><li><a href=\"https://ssc.gov.in/home/apply?utm_source=chatgpt.com\"